    "created_at": "2025-12-12T08:32:12Z",
    "updated_at": "2025-12-12T08:32:12Z",
    "body": "It would indeed be great to have Homarr automatically discover services like Homepage or Dashy do it. \n\n[This thread](https://medium.com/@bhautik2902/building-a-centralized-service-gateway-with-traefik-and-dashy-44df7d6fc277) mentions dashy's auto service discovery mechanism for traefik hosts/services - although it does not seem to be mentioned in the dashy docs themselves, might be AI slop, there is an alternative [here](https://github.com/Lissy93/dashy/discussions/1688#discussioncomment-13100515): \n\n\n```yml\n- type: \"traefik-discovery\"\n  name: \"All Services\"\n  traefikApiUrl: \"http://traefik:8080/api/http/routers\"\n\n```",
    "author_association": "CONTRIBUTOR",
    "pin": null,
